      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-9">It has come to our attention that there are several hosts
performing useful public services on sockets which conflict with
the above scheme. We hope we can resolve this problem with a
minimum of disruption.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-10">The following is a tabulation of socket numbers together with the
services offered. This listing is presented as an aid to network
users. If you know of a socket/function which has been left out
or an entry which should be corrected or deleted please contact:</t>
